      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Stores embeddings in \na dedicated .vec file.\n\nMaintains a index mapping \nPK + timestamp to \nembedding id, then \nretrieves embeddings for \nvalid candidates only, \ncomputes cosine similarity,\nand returns Top-K results \nefficiently.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Stores embeddings in \na dedicated .vec file.\n\nMaintains a index mapping \nPK + timestamp to \nembedding id, then \nretrieves embeddings for \nvalid candidates only, \ncomputes cosine similarity,\nand returns Top-K results \nefficiently.",
